counterfactuals.output:
A furnace valve comprising:

a valve seat;

a shutter configured to seat against said valve seat;

an eccentric sleeve rotatably mounted and operatively coupled to said shutter, said eccentric sleeve being rotatable to lift said shutter off said valve seat; and

a rotating shaft disposed within said eccentric sleeve, said rotating shaft having a tilting arm operatively coupled to said shutter and configured, upon rotation of said rotating shaft, to tilt said shutter away from said valve seat after said shutter has been lifted off said valve seat by rotation of said eccentric sleeve.
